---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Whatever is Lovely">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold uppercase text-terra">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Last updated: November 2026 · Demo policy for the client presentation — replace with real legal text before launch.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      <p>Whatever is Lovely (“we”, “us”) respects your privacy. This page explains what information we collect when you visit this website or send us an enquiry, and how we use it.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-terra">What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you fill in the Work With Us form, we receive the details you type — your names, email address, wedding date and message. Your browser also shares basic technical information (such as pages visited) that helps us keep the site working.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-terra">How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your enquiry details only to reply to you and to plan your wedding. We do not sell, rent or share your personal information with anyone else, except where the law requires it.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-terra">Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us at any time to correct or delete the details you shared with us — just email hello@whateverislovely.com and we will take care of it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
